      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this extra gateway service is only for maintaing small set of IPs\nso that exchange can whitelist these IPs.\nI dont think this extra service is needed.. we can use Order service itself",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this extra gateway service is only for maintaing small set of IPs\nso that exchange can whitelist these IPs.\nI dont think this extra service is needed.. we can use Order service itself",
